#8717
Before the Mansion~
	A large mansion looms in front of you.  Of all the buildings you
have seen in this underworld, this has to be the most amazing.  It is 
almost fully intact.  There is still glass in the windows,  the main doors
look very solid, there is even a wisp of smoking curling out from the 
chimney.  Obviously this building has not been abandoned.
~
