#8718
Inside the Mansion~
	Simply beautiful.  Many a king would be jealous by the furnishings
of this place.  Paintings adorn every wall, next to splendid tapestries woven
of silk and gold.  Velvet covered chairs, and hand carved tables clutter the
room.  The fireplace looks very inviting, like you could rest and relax here
after a long day.
